  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">행사하는 날</span></b> 한켠에<br>태블릿을 거치대에 세워놓으면<br>좋을 것 같아<br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">웹앱을</span></b> 만들어보았습니다. <br><br><a href=\"https://stringweek-cyber.github.io/4x4school/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://stringweek-cyber.github.io/4x4school/</a><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a8f14bba527b33f345491f7ee3c1583efbe4aeeb\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a8f14bba527b33f345491f7ee3c1583efbe4aeeb\" data-origin-width=\"2252\" data-origin-height=\"4000\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2d922e70f65988affb9fb0cc22d1198b4c42bbb4\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2d922e70f65988affb9fb0cc22d1198b4c42bbb4\" data-origin-width=\"2252\" data-origin-height=\"4000\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/71eab6f0afff895b039677643c75d6c04523271e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/71eab6f0afff895b039677643c75d6c04523271e\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"2219\"><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"color: #0DB4A0;\">학번이름으로 파일명</span></b>이 저장되어<br>파일 전달할 수 있고</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/42edd1504d3d3f7fe8e2d54ed204f76d327391ee\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/42edd1504d3d3f7fe8e2d54ed204f76d327391ee\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"2131\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"color: #1B711D;\">6장 찍고</span></b> 4장 선택 후</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/15d5b2bbe8a5f0ed2218c0010154f418b8586833\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/15d5b2bbe8a5f0ed2218c0010154f418b8586833\" data-origin-width=\"1067\" data-origin-height=\"1241\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"color: #EF6F53;\">프레임과 멘트</span></b> 지정하고</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3e274ed0876a88ef4c4c6f450c0371ef946d465d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3e274ed0876a88ef4c4c6f450c0371ef946d465d\" data-origin-width=\"1000\" data-origin-height=\"1426\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">다운로드</span></b> 할 수 있습니당&#10084;&#65039;<br><br>원래 체육대회 때 쓰려고 만들었는데<br>과학행사도 좋을 것 같네요.<br><br>학교에 굴러다니는<br><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">태블릿과 거치대면</span></b><br>공짜로 인생4컷이!<br><br>(혹, 앱에 문제가 있으면 댓글 부탁드립니다)<br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
